/-- **Every system of `ν Catalan.TriakisOctahedron.polyhedron` has its one root at `ν Catalan.TriakisOctahedron.polyhedron`**: each of the systems of `catalanTriakisOctahedron_nu_roots_list` has exactly one root, and its scale is the Nieuwland number. -/
theorem catalanTriakisOctahedron_nu_shared_list :
    PolynomialSystem.IsRootEq [catalanTriakisOctahedron_nu_system_0] Catalan.TriakisOctahedron.polyhedron.nieuwland :=
