/-- **The Nieuwland number of `Catalan.TriakisOctahedron.polyhedron`, by representatives**: `ν Catalan.TriakisOctahedron.polyhedron` lies in `[k, k + 1] / 10 ^ 30`, and it is the first coordinate of the root of each of finitely many systems of integer polynomial equations, each in a rational box of all its variables and each with exactly one root in its box (`IsPolyRootEq`, `Modules/System/PolyRootEq.lean`); the systems are those of `catalanTriakisOctahedron_nu_reps_list`. -/
theorem catalanTriakisOctahedron_nu_reps :
    ν Catalan.TriakisOctahedron.polyhedron ∈ Set.Icc ((1030662492707397797492443451309 : ℝ) / 10 ^ 30) ((1030662492707397797492443451310 : ℝ) / 10 ^ 30) ∧
